      "content": "i know i should talk to them but my doctor is actually out of town until next week and i can't wait that long with this pain. i checked online and some people say it's fine as long as you don't take too much. like, if i just take a low dose of the tramadol, is it really that big of a deal? it seems like a lot of worry for just one pill.",
