      "content": "look i'm not trying to be difficult but i'm literally in tears right now. i just want to know if there is a specific dosage where it's actually safe. like if i took 25mg or 50mg would that be okay? i need a concrete answer so i can decide what to do tonight. please just tell me if a small dose is safe or not.",
